+html.class text-center mb-10
* About me
  Hi there!

  I'm Alejandro, a full-stack web developer, sysadmin and {https://neovim.io}[Neovim] plugin developer and open-source
  lover known as {https://github.com/NTBBloodbath}[NTBBloodbath] on the web. I have a great passion for learning new things and
  developing software to make developers life easier to increase our productivity.

  During my free time I like to do hiking in the mountains or play video games with friends, and
  also contribute to the open-source community.

  @embed html
  <h2><i class="ti ti-address-book"></i> Contact</h2>
  @end
  If you want to contact me you can find me on multiple platforms!

  - *Matrix* - `@ntbbloodbath.matrix.org`
  - *Discord* - `@ntbbloodbath`
  - *Email* - `bloodbathalchemist@protonmail.com`

  @embed html
  <h2><i class="ti ti-key"></i> GPG Public Key</h2>
  @end
  Download my {:/assets/ntbbloodbath_pub.asc:}[GPG public key] for encrypted communication.

  *Fingerprint*:

  `4ABD D342 5BB7 F50A F7B9  10CE 18D6 730B C846 AAC5`

  After importing the key, verify the fingerprint matches using GnuPG.
  @code bash
  gpg --fingerprint bloodbathalchemist@protonmail.com
  @end

